// spec: FUN-007
//
// ⚠️ Expected to FAIL compiled, because of C-8: both processors refuse this
// with the same message, and only the driver's 'Uncaught: ' prefix differs.
// A method's parameter types ARE enforced, because a method goes through
// overload selection and selection compares whole signatures.

class M;
begin
    function Take (N : Integer); begin Exit N; end
end

WriteLn (M ().Take ('a string'));
